      "note": "False positive. The `role` column on estimate_materials is a domain concept (marks a material's functional purpose within an estimate, e.g. 'locks') — it is not a user privilege or access-control field. The permitted value is constrained at two layers: (1) the controller sanitizes the value via presence_in(EstimateMaterial::ROLES) before update, coercing anything outside the allowlist to nil, and (2) the model validates :role with inclusion: { in: ROLES }, allow_nil: true. An attacker cannot escalate privileges by submitting this field. The `short_code` column is a plain domain string read from a form select populated from the material catalog; it resolves to a catalog material and carries no privilege or access-control meaning."
