      "note": "False positive (SPEC-027). The `role` column on contacts is a free-form domain label describing how a GC contact is engaged (e.g. 'estimator', 'project manager') — it is not a user privilege or access-control field. SPEC-027 rules R1/R2 explicitly require permitting it as an optional, unvalidated string. The Contact model carries no authorization logic; this `role` has no bearing on application access control."
